# Jolene, Plundering Pugilist: "Whenever you attack with one or more creatures with power 4 or greater, create a Treasure
# token." (CR 508.1m, 603.2) Jolene is a 4/2, exactly the limit, so attacking with her alone makes one Treasure. "{1}{R},
# Sacrifice a Treasure: Jolene deals 1 damage to any target." (CR 118.3): the Treasure is the cost, gone as the ability is
# activated, and Bot2 takes 4 from the attack and 1 from the ping (20 -> 15).

[Bot1 Deck]
Jolene, Plundering Pugilist
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mountain
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Jolene, Plundering Pugilist.Cast(Spend: R, G, B)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Jolene, Plundering Pugilist > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Token = true
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Jolene, Plundering Pugilist.Activate(Ability: Sacrifice a Treasure; Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token = (absent)
